   "id": "faqs",
   "src": "bde-section-151-211",
   "heading": "faqs",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "How do I track points?",
       "a_html": "<p>We track them for you. Check your receipt, ask a budtender, or peek at your <a href=\"https://lab.alpineiq.com/wallet/4688\" target=\"_blank\">account link</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do I need a phone number?",
       "a_html": "<p>In order to sign up for our Rewards Program powered by Alpine IQ, you’ll need to either provide a phone number or email address. We need at least one of these to create a unique member wallet to store points.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do points expire?",
       "a_html": "<p>Points earned through purchase expire <strong>365 days</strong> from issue date.</p>\n<p>Points gifted to you by staff, for your birthday or any other way besides purchase never expire as long as you have an active account!</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How does the referral program work?",
       "a_html": "<p>Refer a friend via your own unique and personal Alpine IQ referral link. This can be found in any emails you may reveive from us.</p>\n<p>Share that link and get 100 points for every friend that signs up. They also receive 10% off their first purchase.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "When do points post?",
       "a_html": "<p>Please allow up to 24 hours for points earned via purchase to appear in your AIQ wallet.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Anything I can’t earn or redeem on?",
       "a_html": "<p>Points aren’t earned on taxes, tips, or gift cards and can’t be used to pay taxes or fees. Some promo‑priced items may be excluded—ask us!</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can I stack discounts?",
       "a_html": "<p>You can use points with many promos, but some offers can’t be combined. We’ll always try to get you the best value.</p>"
      }
     ]
    }
